# read by lane127.sh when the scan starts (appended to point.env): t5's order (hc 26 Nov ~12:48 UTC by t5's clock): "Scan with the new scanner at lambda -0.02, -0.01, 0.00, 0.01 plus a repeat of 0.00, at most 2 processes (k_c 127 may need more memory; watch it)":
